<section id="get-started">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--site-content-width)] px-4 pt-24 pb-16 sm:px-6 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">Get Miko running.</h2>
        <p class="text-theme-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">Two commands. A guided setup. Your first task.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="quickstart-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Add the setup skills</h3><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Run this in your terminal.</p>
            <div class="quickstart-command"><code>npx skills add nexmoe/atmiko -g</code><button type="button" data-copy-command="npx skills add nexmoe/atmiko -g" aria-label="Copy skills command">Copy</button></div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Start the guided setup</h3><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">In Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, or your coding agent, run:</p>
            <div class="quickstart-command"><code>/atmiko-setup</code><button type="button" data-copy-command="/atmiko-setup" aria-label="Copy setup command">Copy</button></div>
            <p class="text-theme-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Choose your integrations, connect your coding credentials, and add your repositories. The setup checks prerequisites, installs Miko from source, and helps you launch it.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Give Miko its first task</h3><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assign a Linear issue, or @Miko in a configured GitHub PR, GitLab MR, or Slack conversation. Follow progress in your tools or the local <code>/board</code>.</p><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Keep the worker and any tunnel running so new tasks can reach Miko.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-theme-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">Installing the skills adds the setup workflow. Running <code>/atmiko-setup</code> installs the runtime. You sign in and approve access to your accounts during setup.</p>
      <p class="quickstart-status text-theme-text-muted text-xs" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-theme-accent hover:bg-theme-accent-hover text-theme-accent-contrast h-11 px-6 text-sm" href="https://github.com/nexmoe/atmiko#self-hosted-setup">Read the quick start ↗</a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-theme-card-03-hex text-theme-text h-11 px-6 text-sm" href="https://github.com/nexmoe/atmiko/blob/main/docs/SELF_HOSTING.md">Manual setup ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

